    "summary": "Conscript-and-professional army with the volunteer Riflemen's Union, guarding the Suwalki Gap between Belarus and Kaliningrad. Hosts Germany's permanently based 45th Panzer Brigade. Buying Leopard 2A8, CV90 and CAESAR; already fields Boxer 'Vilkas' and a large JLTV fleet.",
    "squad_size": 8,
    "fireteam": "8-man squad in two teams.",
    "tactics": [
      "total defence: reservists and volunteer defence league ambush along forest roads",
      "anti-armour teams with Javelin and Carl Gustaf in depth",
      "dispersal and camouflage against drones",
      "NATO forward-presence battlegroup integration",
      "obstacle belts and pre-planned demolitions as map features"
    ],
